From c97cd05df9d5983873aee0e23b03f5ed7fad789e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rohit Agrawal <rohit.agrawal@databricks.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Oct 2025 05:35:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] xds: deprecate flag report_load_with_rq_issued and remove
 legacy code paths (#41614)

## Description

This PR removes the deprecated reloadable flag
`report_load_with_rq_issued` and cleans up the legacy paths.

Fix https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/issues/41509

---

**Commit Message:** router: deprecate flag report_load_with_rq_issued
and remove legacy code paths
**Additional Description:** Remove the deprecated reloadable flag
`report_load_with_rq_issued` and cleans up the legacy paths.
**Risk Level:** Low
**Testing:** CI
**Docs Changes:** N/A
**Release Notes:** Added

Signed-off-by: Rohit Agrawal <rohit.agrawal@databricks.com>
---
